<title>UK: Dresdner Bank unit sets 200 bln lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank unit sets 200 bln lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Bank and Istituto Bancario San Paolo Di Torino.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIT   SPREAD     -25 BP    MATURITY	.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.12    FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.87</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
